/dist/

# The mirrored PDFs run to ~2.8 GB and are re-fetchable from cbe.org.eg using
# the sha256 in corpus/manifest.json. What we keep instead is the extracted
# text, which is what search actually needs and is two orders of magnitude
# smaller. Deep links point at CBE's own copy.
/corpus/files/
